{"ID":"20240521133122-mjh2297","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","icon":"1f3b8","id":"20240521133122-mjh2297","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240521133122-mjh2297\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240521133130-v6y20ki\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240521133216-o5syn1z\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240521133130-v6y20ki\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:0\u0026#125;","title":"4.所有病人飲食必須遵守事項","type":"doc","updated":"20240521150804"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240521133130-v6y20ki","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521133130-v6y20ki","updated":"20240521133133"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"1.      停止服用任何維生素及營養補充食品。"}]},{"ID":"20240521133130-0zh9z9g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521133130-0zh9z9g","updated":"20240521133130"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"2."},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"      "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"停止服用鈣片及降膽固醇藥, 逐量遞減類固醇, 抗憂鬱及抗焦慮症的藥。"}]},{"ID":"20240521133130-4yjie1v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521133130-4yjie1v","updated":"20240521133130"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"3."},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"      "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"不可食用奶製品如牛奶, 起司, 乳酪, 冰淇淋等, 可多食用豆奶或米漿來代替。"}]},{"ID":"20240521133130-vrurfbq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521133130-vrurfbq","updated":"20240521133130"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"4."},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"      "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"停止使用所有人工糖及人工糖所製造的食品如巧克力, 餅乾, 糖果, 可樂等。"}]},{"ID":"20240521133130-0f3vztt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521133130-0f3vztt","updated":"20240521133213"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"5."},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"      "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"喜愛甜食者可以使用天然蔗糖或蜂蜜來代替其他糖的使用。"}]},{"ID":"20240521133130-l24bqp8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521133130-l24bqp8","updated":"20240521133215"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"6."},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"      "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"多吃海鹽或是岩鹽來代替人工的精煉鹽。"}]},{"ID":"20240521133130-2zqxue2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521133130-2zqxue2","updated":"20240521133130"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"7."},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"      "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"不可以喝咖啡, 可以多喝綠茶來代替。"}]},{"ID":"20240521133130-07dzffl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521133130-07dzffl","updated":"20240521133130"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"8."},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"      "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"多食用天然食物來代替營養補充食品, 避免食用太多營養添加物的食物。."}]},{"ID":"20240521133130-fp47tun","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521133130-fp47tun","updated":"20240521133130"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"9."},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"      "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"多喝水, 綠茶及自製天然果汁, 少喝酒及其他人工飲料。"}]},{"ID":"20240521133130-zsn3i7a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521133130-zsn3i7a","updated":"20240521133203"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"10. \t 腎病病人及水腫病人要少鹽飲食。"}]},{"ID":"20240521133130-zn2ck4a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521133130-zn2ck4a","updated":"20240521133145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"11\t腎病病人禁止吃楊桃。"}]},{"ID":"20240521133130-55pvevo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521133130-55pvevo","updated":"20240521133220"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"12.  女性在月經期間避免吃生冷食物及飲料。"}]},{"ID":"20240521133158-aapp6fe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521133158-aapp6fe"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"今天正逢西洋人的愚人節，我的做法卻正好與一般人相反，我不但不想愚弄世人，我還要告訴世人，你們都被西藥廠與衛生署愚弄了一生，不要繼續再被它們愚弄下去了，世人如果以為我今天利用愚人節在愚弄你們，你們就錯了，你們不知道你們每天都在過愚人節，真是笨啊，請醒醒吧，不要繼續每天再過愚人節了。"}]},{"ID":"20240521133229-nhfbeyi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521133229-nhfbeyi"}},{"ID":"20240521133216-o5syn1z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521133216-o5syn1z","updated":"20240521133228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"漢唐中醫 倪海廈謹記於佛州桃花島2009年04月01日"}]}]}